  <description>
    PX4-compatible quadrotor drone using PhoenixDrone STL meshes.
    Equipped with downward-facing camera, 360° 2D LiDAR, IMU,
    GPS, barometer, and magnetometer for pothole detection missions.
  </description>
</model>
